# RIMMSQOL and the shared steps that drive its real MainButtons list. This pass exists so that "can RIMMSQOL list and reveal
# RimBabel's settings shortcut, and does the revealed button open the same settings as Mod options" rests on a run and not on
# reading its source (MOD_SETTINGS.md, shortcut integration). Adapted from BillAutopilot's pass of the same name.
#
# The steps are PickleTools/RimmsqolSteps, not something this mod wrote. PickleTools has to be cloned beside the mods under
# exactly that name: the path below is relative to the collection's root, and the folder's own About.xml packageId must equal
# the one written here. The requirement tags of 03-rimmsqol-shortcut.feature keep it out of any pass where RIMMSQOL or the
# steps are absent.
MalteSchulze.RIMMSqol            1084452457
nelim.pickletools.rimmsqol       path:PickleTools/RimmsqolSteps/Mod
